  "evidence": "Collecting Signatures: You need to gather 100,000 valid signatures from eligible voters within 100 days after the law has been published in the Federal Gazette (the official journal). Automatic Referendum: If a law is published, a referendum automatically becomes possible after 18 months have elapsed since its publication, without the need for collecting signatures."
